# Build context hygiene for cloud/bridge/Dockerfile and selfhost/Dockerfile
# (build from the repository root). Only what the Dockerfiles COPY should
# reach the daemon; secrets never do.
#
# api/, public/ and scripts/ stay reachable: selfhost/Dockerfile COPYs them
# (the serve entry mounts api/ + public/, and api routes import scripts/).
**/node_modules
node_modules
.git
.github
.vercel
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
*.key
**/*.secret*
**/*-export*.json
coverage
reference
docs
test
.planning
.claude
.agents
*.log
